#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "First Aid"
msgstr "Первая помощь"

#. ~ Description of profession "First Aid" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've got training and some experience in dealing with urgent injuries.  In"
" the absence of any medical professionals, that'll have to do."
msgstr ""
"У вас есть подготовка и некоторый опыт работы с неотложными травмами.  При "
"отсутствии других врачей вам придётся обходиться этим."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "First Aid"
msgstr "Первая помощь"

#. ~ Description of profession "First Aid" for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
