#. ~ Condition description of martial technique "Biojutsu Takedown"
#. ~ Condition description of martial technique "Toad's Tongue"
#. ~ Condition description of martial technique "Centipede Bite"
#. ~ Condition description of martial technique "Colossus Strike"
