"биохимии и биологии.  С помощью вашей верной ступки и пестика вы надеетесь "
"размолоть нежить в кашу."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Gangster"
msgstr "Гангстер"

#. ~ Description of profession "Gangster" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The boss always said he could rely on you to pull through on the tough jobs."
"  Shame he got himself smoked.  No problem; the world's always got a place "
"for someone with your kind of talents."
msgstr ""
"Босс всегда говорил, что на вас можно положиться в самых грязных делах.  "
"Жаль, он позволил себя завалить.  Ничего страшного — в мире всегда найдётся "
"место для человека твоих талантов."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Gangster"
msgstr "Гангстер"

#. ~ Description of profession "Gangster" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The boss always said he could rely on you to pull through on the tough jobs."
"  Shame he got himself smoked.  No problem; the world's always got a place "
"for someone with your kind of talents."
msgstr ""
