#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Paramedic Firefighter"
msgstr "Пожарный парамедик"

#. ~ Description of profession "Paramedic Firefighter" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"On your way to respond to an emergency call, you nearly drove straight into "
"a riot in the city.  Turning off of the burning, debris-covered streets, you"
" took a long detour only to find yourself lost.  That call will have to wait"
" - you're in an emergency of your own now."
msgstr ""
"По дороге на вызов службы экстренной помощи вы чуть не попали прямо в "
"городские беспорядки.  Свернув с горящих, засыпанных мусором улиц, вы "
"сделали длинный крюк и заблудились.  Вызову придётся подождать - теперь в "
"чрезвычайной ситуации находитесь вы."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Paramedic Firefighter"
msgstr "Пожарный парамедик"

#. ~ Description of profession "Paramedic Firefighter" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
