#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Biker"
msgstr "Байкер"

#. ~ Description of profession "Biker" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent most of your life on a motorcycle, out on the open road with your "
"club.  Now they're all dead.  Time to ride or die."
msgstr ""
"Большую часть своей жизни вы не слезали с мотоцикла, покоряя дороги с "
"членами вашего клуба.  Теперь все они мертвы.  Лети вдаль или умри."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Biker"
msgstr "Байкерша"

#. ~ Description of profession "Biker" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
