#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Unwilling Mutant"
msgstr "Невольный мутант"

#. ~ Description of profession "Unwilling Mutant" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a human guinea pig, used by laboratory technicians to understand "
"the immense power of mutation.  You are determined to live on, if only to "
"spite them for what they did to you."
msgstr ""
"Вы были подопытным кроликом, на котором лаборанты изучали безмерную силу "
"мутаций.  Теперь вы полны решимости выжить вопреки всему, что с вами "
"сделали."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
