"сделали."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Volunteer Mutant"
msgstr "Добровольный мутант"

#. ~ Description of profession "Volunteer Mutant" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your dreams of becoming a mutant superhero through genetic alteration may "
"have fallen a bit short, but the scientists say you're ready.  It's time for"
" a field test."
msgstr ""
"Ваши мечты стать супергероем-мутантом благодаря генетическим изменениям, "
"возможно, немного не сбылись, но ученые говорят, что вы готовы.  Пришло "
"время для полевых испытаний."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Volunteer Mutant"
msgstr "Добровольный мутант"

#. ~ Description of profession "Volunteer Mutant" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
