"время для полевых испытаний."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Hitchhiker"
msgstr "Автостопщик"

#. ~ Description of profession "Hitchhiker" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your house has been demolished and your planet destroyed, but at least you "
"still have your towel."
msgstr ""
"Ваш дом снесён, планета уничтожена, но не беда, главное, что у вас всё ещё "
"есть полотенце."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Hitchhiker"
msgstr "Автостопщица"

#. ~ Description of profession "Hitchhiker" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
