"вас."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Zoo Keeper"
msgstr "Смотритель зоопарка"

#. ~ Description of profession "Zoo Keeper" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were called in on your day off to feed the animals at the zoo.  For some"
" reason, none of your coworkers bothered showing up for work today."
msgstr ""
"Вас вызвали на работу в выходной, чтобы вы покормили животных.  Почему-то "
"никто из ваших коллег не вышел на работу."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Zoo Keeper"
msgstr "Смотрительница зоопарка"

#. ~ Description of profession "Zoo Keeper" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were called in on your day off to feed the animals at the zoo.  For some"
" reason, none of your coworkers bothered showing up for work today."
msgstr ""
"Вас вызвали на работу в выходной, чтобы вы покормили животных.  Почему-то "
"никто из ваших коллег не вышел на работу."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Urban Samurai"
msgstr "Городской самурай"

#. ~ Description of profession "Urban Samurai" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were always an inexplicable sight in town, with your funny hair and odd "
"Japanese clothes.  Little of this concerned you, but last week the grocery "
"service stopped coming and now the TV no longer turns on.  This displeases "
"you."
msgstr ""
"Вы всегда выделялись в городе своим видом, забавной причёской и странной "
"японской одеждой.  Вас это мало волновало, но в последнюю неделю доставки из"
" бакалеи прекратились, а телевизор больше не включается.  Вас это "
"раздражает."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Urban Samurai"
msgstr "Городской самурай"

#. ~ Description of profession "Urban Samurai" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
