"человека."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Heist Driver"
msgstr "Водитель-грабитель"

#. ~ Description of profession "Heist Driver" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"For as long as you can remember, you have lived a double life: a normal "
"driver by the day and a heist driver in the night.  Now there are no cops "
"and no law, but even after the Cataclysm, you drive."
msgstr ""
"Сколько вы себя помните, вы жили двойной жизнью: обычный водитель днём, а "
"ночью - грабитель.  Сейчас нет ни копов, ни закона, но даже после Катаклизма"
" вы продолжаете крутить баранку."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Heist Driver"
msgstr "Водитель-грабитель"

#. ~ Description of profession "Heist Driver" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
