#. ~ Description of vehicle part "wall light"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid "A wall-mounted lamp that provides illumination when turned on."
msgstr "Настенная лампа, обеспечивающая освещение при включении."

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
