#. ~ Bashing failed sound of terrain "boarded up reinforced door"
#. ~ Bashing failed sound of terrain "boarded up damaged reinforced door"
#. ~ Bashing failed sound of terrain "boarded up damaged door with peephole"
#. ~ Bashing failed sound of terrain "open wooden gate"
