msgstr "обесточенная система управления"

#. ~ Description of terrain "powerless controls"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid "The control face for an elevator.  It's currently unpowered."
msgstr "Контрольная панель лифта.  На данный момент обесточена."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
