"Round and rectangular steel plates are fastened together to protect all four"
" sides of the torso.  It can be worn on top of other armor like chainmail "
"and brigandines.  This set is crudely put together with square plates of "
"mild steel."
msgstr ""
"Зеркальная броня получила свое название благодаря своей форме и "
