#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid ""
"It contains The Sacred Laws of the Aryas (Dharmasastra), part 1/2: "
"Âpastamba, Gautama, Vâsishtha and Baudhâyana."
msgstr ""
"Он содержит Священные Законы Арьев (Дхармашастра), часть 1/2: Апастамба, "
