#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 5" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid ""
"It contains the Pahlavi Texts, part 1/5: Bundahis, selections of Zâd-sparam,"
