#. ~ Description of "Tanakh"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid ""
"A single-volume book containing the complete canon of the Jewish Bible."
msgstr "Однотомная книга, содержащая полный канон еврейской библии."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
