#. ~ Description of "lutefisk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Preserved fish that has been dried in a lye solution.  Vile and soap-like "
"yet highly nutritious, it is reminiscent of the afterbirth of a dog or the "
"world's largest chunk of phlegm."
msgstr ""
"Сушёная рыба, которая замачивается в щелочном растворе.  Мерзкое и похожее "
