msgstr "Базовые характеристики портальных заклинаний."

#. ~ Description of spell "Base characteristics of portal spells"
#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
msgid "Base portal stats."
msgstr "Базовые характеристики портала."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
msgid "Shifting Mass Attack"
msgstr "Атака движущейся массы"

#. ~ Description of spell "Shifting Mass Attack"
#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
msgid "Drains some of your essence."
msgstr "Вытягивает вашу эссенцию."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
msgid "Hurt Self"
msgstr "Нанесение вреда себе"

#. ~ Description of spell "Hurt Self"
#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
msgid "Touching/perceiving you is bad for the other side as well."
msgstr "Прикосновение/восприятие вас также плохо для противника."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
msgid "Impossible Shape Attack"
msgstr "Атака невозможной формы"

#. ~ Description of spell "Impossible Shape Attack"
#. ~ Description of spell "Twisting Blade Attack"
#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
msgid "Hurts you mentally."
msgstr "Вредит вам ментально."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_impossible_shape_attack"
#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
msgid ""
"Your mind lurches, the shapes and figures dance across your vision, you feel"
" like your head is going to explode."
msgstr ""
"Ваш разум кренится, формы и фигуры танцуют перед вашими глазами, вы "
"чувствуете, что ваша голова вот-вот взорвется."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_impossible_shape_attack"
#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
msgid ""
"You can't look away from the impossible shape, staring at it is making you "
"feel sick, you have to get away!"
msgstr ""
"Вы не можете отвести взгляд от невозможной формы, глядя на нее, вас тошнит, "
"вам нужно уйти!"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
msgid "Absence Capture Attack"
msgstr "Атака отсутствующим захватом"

#. ~ Description of spell "Absence Capture Attack"
#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
msgid "Traps you with nothing."
msgstr "Ловит вас ничем."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_absence_capture_attack"
#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
msgid ""
"All the empty space around you is suddenly even emptier than should be "
"possible."
msgstr ""
"Все пустое пространство вокруг вас внезапно становится даже более пустым, "
"чем вообще возможно."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_absence_capture_attack"
#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
msgid "For an instant you feel the absence's hunger upon you."
msgstr "На мгновение вы ощущаете голод Отсутствия."

#. ~ Description of spell "Skunk Spray"
#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
msgid "Skunk spray defense mechanism."
msgstr "Защитный механизм скунса."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
msgid "Initial Boomer Claymore Attack"
msgstr "Начальная атака бумера-клеймора"

#. ~ Description of spell "Initial Boomer Claymore Attack"
#. ~ Description of spell "Boomer Claymore Attack"
#. ~ Description of spell "Boomer Suicide Spell"
#. ~ Description of spell "Hallucination Touch Dissipation"
#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
msgid "Nothing to see here."
msgstr "Здесь ничего нет."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
msgid "Boomer Claymore Attack"
msgstr "Атака бумера-клеймора"

