#. ~ Description of spell "Void Weaver Death"
#. ~ Description of spell "Unfold Collapse"
#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/void_spider_mechanics.json
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
msgid "Ends the fight."
