#. ~ Player makes sound in effect in EoC "void_spider_life_remaining" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_VOID_SPIDER_CONTROL"
#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/void_spider_mechanics.json
msgid "the spider mimic an anguished scream"
