#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
msgid "I didn't meet you in the subway though.  You left."
msgstr "Но я встретил тебя не в метро.  Ты ушёл оттуда."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
