msgstr "Усы-подкову."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/haircutting.json
msgid "Get some mutton chops."
msgstr "Бороду-баранья отбивная."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/haircutting.json
