#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, let's go!"
msgstr "Ладно, пошли!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Yeah… I don't think so."
msgstr "Да?  Я так не думаю."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "В чём дело?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Return Barry to Eddie at the dairy."
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "How much further?"
msgstr "Далеко ещё?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'd like to lead for a while."
msgstr "Я бы хотел стать лидером на какое-то время."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Step aside.  I'm leader now."
msgstr "В сторону.  Теперь я лидер."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright.  You can lead now."
msgstr "Хорошо.  Веди нас."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Good.  Something else…"
msgstr "Хорошо.  Кое-что ещё…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright, let's go."
msgstr "Да, пошли."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, okay."
msgstr "Ладно, ладно."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright, show me how it's done."
msgstr "Ладно, покажи мне, как это делается."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, let's begin."
msgstr "Хорошо, приступим."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay.  Lead the way."
msgstr "Ладно.  Веди меня."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "No, we'll be okay here."
msgstr "Нет, мы здесь будем в порядке."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "On second thought, never mind."
msgstr "А впрочем, неважно."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright, who should participate?"
msgstr "Ладно, кто будет участвовать?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Let's see…"
msgstr "Посмотрим…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright, let's begin."
msgstr "Хорошо, приступим."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr "Хорошо."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I can't train you properly while you're operating a vehicle!"
msgstr "Я не могу полноценно обучать тебя, пока ты за рулём!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I can't train you properly while I'm operating a vehicle!"
msgstr "Я не могу тебя учить, когда я за рулём!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Give it some time, I'll show you something new later…"
msgstr "Дайте мне немного времени, и я покажу что-то новое…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I have some reason for denying you training."
msgstr "У меня есть причины не учить тебя."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"We'll talk about a training seminar after you're done operating that "
"vehicle."
msgstr ""
"Мы поговорим об тренировках после того, как ты перестанешь управлять "
"транспортом."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I can't host a seminar while I'm operating a vehicle!"
msgstr "Я не могу учить, пока я за рулём!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Give it some time, we'll talk about a training seminar later…"
msgstr "Дайте мне немного времени, поговорим о занятиях позже…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I have some reason to refuse hosting a training seminar."
msgstr "У меня есть причины не проводить учебное занятие."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Not a bloody chance, I'm going to get left behind!"
msgstr "Ни единого шанса, я сматываю удочки!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid "Fine."
msgstr "Хорошо."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm on watch."
msgstr "Я на страже."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "I need you to come with me."
msgstr "Тебе нужно пойти со мной."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ Affirmative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
