msgid "Really, I haven't heard anything about it.  What's it you need?"
msgstr ""
"Серьёзно, я ничего не знаю ни о какой доставке.  Что именно тебе нужно?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "The boss wants your accounting papers, I need them."
msgstr "Боссу хочет видеть бухгалтерские документы, они мне нужны."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Oh nothing, I must have the wrong person."
msgstr "О, ничего, видимо, мне нужен другой человек."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "They're not ready yet, you'll have to come back later."
msgstr "Они ещё не готовы, зайди за ними позже."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "I'll just take them as is, thanks.  Everything can be finalized later."
msgstr "Я возьму их как есть, спасибо.  Завершить можно позже."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "We both know that's a lie.  Hand them over, or else."
msgstr "Мы же знаем, что это ложь.  Отдавай их по-хорошему."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Could I get them for a price?"
msgstr "Могу я выкупить их за деньги?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "When will they be ready?"
msgstr "Когда они будут закончены?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Okay, see ya."
msgstr "Окей, увидимся."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I told you already, I'm not finished with them, come back later."
msgstr "Я же сказала тебе, я ещё не закончила, зайди позже."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I told you already, I'm not finished with them, come back later."
msgstr "Я же сказал тебе, я ещё не закончил, зайди позже."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I told you already, I'm not finished with them, come back later."
msgstr "Я же говорю, они ещё на закончены, приходи позже."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid ""
"Just two more days is all I need with them, then the boss can do whatever.  "
"Is that good?"
msgstr ""
"Ещё два дня мне хватит, затем босс может делать с ними что захочет.  Идёт?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Alright, I'll be back then."
msgstr "Идёт, я вернуть позже."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "No, I need them now."
msgstr "Нет, они нужны мне сейчас."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid ""
"I don't know what the hell you want them for, but I sure don't care.  Take "
"'em, <name_b>."
msgstr ""
"Я не знаю, какого чёрта они тебе так потребовались, мне плевать.  Забирай, "
"<name_b>."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Thanks, <name_b>."
msgstr "Спасибо, <name_b>."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "How much are you thinking?"
msgstr "Договоримся о цене?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Does $5 sound good?"
msgstr "$5, звучит неплохо, да?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "How about $20?"
msgstr "Как насчёт $20?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "I'll give you $50, my best offer."
msgstr "Даю $50, это максимум."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid ""
"*holds their abdomen as they nearly keel over from laughter.  \"You better "
"be glad that I think you're funny, anyone else would find it an insult.  "
"$150 is more like it to me."
msgstr ""
"*сгибается пополам от смеха.  «Радуйся что мне это показалось смешным, любой"
" другой бы счёл это за оскорбление. $150 мне больше нравится."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Alright, here it is."
msgstr "Хорошо, вот."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "I don't take kindly to your jokes, <name_b>.  Hand 'em over or else."
msgstr "Мне не нравятся твои шутки, <name_b>.  Отдавай их по-хорошему."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid ""
"*seems to get lost in thought for a moment, before looking back at you.  "
"\"Alright, you have a deal."
msgstr "*задумывается, затем смотрит на вас.  «Хорошо, по рукам."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Pleasure doing business."
msgstr "Приятно было иметь дело."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid ""
"*seems to get lost in thought for a moment, before looking back at you.  "
"\"Nah, I think $150 would be a better price."
msgstr "*задумывается, затем смотрит на вас.  «Не, $150 было бы лучшей ценой."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "How about I don't give you any money instead?  Hand 'em over or else."
msgstr ""
"А как насчёт того, что я тебе вообще не заплачу.  Отдай их мне сейчас же."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Ah, a rich man I see.  I think you have yourself a deal."
msgstr "О, а ты богачка, как я вижу.  Думаю, ты урвала себе сделку."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Ah, a rich man I see.  I think you have yourself a deal."
msgstr "О, а ты богач, как я вижу.  Думаю, ты урвал себе сделку."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Ah, a rich man I see.  I think you have yourself a deal."
msgstr "О, а ты обеспеченный человек, как я вижу.  Думаю, сделка принята."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Sounds great to me."
msgstr "Отлично, как по мне."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "I think you can go a bit higher, $150 and the records are yours."
msgstr "Думаю, ты можешь и больше. $150 и документы твой."

#. ~ NPC makes sound in effect in EoC "EOC_BRIBE_20_FALSE_EFFECT"
#. ~ NPC makes sound in effect in EoC "EOC_BRIBE_50_FALSE_EFFECT"
#. ~ NPC makes sound in effect in EoC "EOC_BRIBE_150_FALSE_EFFECT"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Come back later when you have the money, then we'll talk."
msgstr "Возвращайся когда будут деньги, тогда и поговорим."

#. ~ NPC makes sound in effect in EoC "EOC_BRIBE_LATER_TRUE_EFFECT"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "A pleasure doin' business with you."
msgstr "Приятно иметь с тобой дело."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
msgid ""
"Well well well, another traveler.  Don't try anything suspicious, you're "
"outnumbered here and we're well armed, and my boss will know what happens "
"soon enough."
msgstr ""
"Ну-ну-ну, ещё один путешественник.  Не делай ничего подозрительного, у нас "
"численное преимущество и мы хорошо вооружены, и мой босс сразу же узнает, "
"что тут произошло."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Are you threatening me?"
msgstr "Ты мне угрожаешь?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "What's your deal here?"
msgstr "Что ты здесь делаешь?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "I won't try anything if you don't.  Just passing through."
msgstr ""
"Я не буду вытворять фокусов, если ты не начнёшь.  Просто прохожу мимо."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Do you have anything to trade?"
msgstr "Есть, что на продажу?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Your prices seem awfully high."
msgstr "Здесь цены ужасно высокие."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Nothing much.  Just passing through."
msgstr "Ничего.  Просто прохожу мимо."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid ""
"No, not at all.  Just being cautious.  You know how it gets out here.  We're"
" not looking for trouble.  In fact, if you've got anything worthwhile, maybe"
" we could do a little trading."
msgstr ""
"Нет, нет.  Просто осторожничаю.  Знаешь, как всё бывает.  Мы не ищем "
"неприятностей.  На самом деле, если у тебя есть что-нибудь стоящее, мы могли"
" бы немного поторговать."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Sure, let's trade."
msgstr "Конечно, давай поторгуем."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "That suits me fine.  I'll be on my way."
msgstr "Хорошо.  Ну, я пошёл."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm a businessman, and business is my game.  I came out here to help these "
"poor, poor people who are doing without in such a bad time."
msgstr ""
"Я деловой человек, и бизнес это моя игра.  Я здесь, чтобы помочь этим "
"бедолагам, которые живут в такое непростое время."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
