msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Fuck off, dickwaddle."
msgstr "Отъебись, урод."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Fuck off, dickwaddle."
msgstr "Отъебись, гондон."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Yo.  Anyone else keen on moving from this bus stop to your tent city?"
msgstr ""
"Йо.  Кто-нибудь горит желанием отправиться с этой остановки до твоего "
"палаточного города?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Hey there.  Good to see you again."
msgstr "Привет.  Рад снова тебя видеть."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Careful, I'm getting hangry again and am not totally responsible for my own "
"actions."
msgstr "Осторожно, мне снова хочется жрать, и я не отвечаю за свои действия."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Look, I'm sorry for freaking out earlier.  You might be an asshole but I'm "
"sure you didn't mean it like that.  My blood sugar is hella low, I get a bit"
" cranky.  We cool?"
msgstr ""
"Слушай, прости за, то что я тогда вспылила.  Ты, может, и полная сука, но я "
"знаю, что ты не хотела меня задеть.  Когда у меня адски падает сахар в "
"крови, то меня немного штормит.  Без обид?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Look, I'm sorry for freaking out earlier.  You might be an asshole but I'm "
"sure you didn't mean it like that.  My blood sugar is hella low, I get a bit"
" cranky.  We cool?"
msgstr ""
"Слушай, прости за, то что я тогда вспылила.  Ты, может, и полный урод, но я "
"знаю, что ты не хотел меня задеть.  Когда у меня адски падает сахар в крови,"
" то меня немного штормит.  Без обид?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Look, I'm sorry for freaking out earlier.  You might be an asshole but I'm "
"sure you didn't mean it like that.  My blood sugar is hella low, I get a bit"
" cranky.  We cool?"
msgstr ""
"Слушай, прости за тот нервяк.  Ты, может, и мудила, но ты ни при чём.  У "
"меня адски падает сахар в крови, меня немного штормит.  Без обид?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Hey there, not-asshole.  Good to see you again."
msgstr "Эй, привет, не-сучка.  Рада снова тебя видеть."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Hey there, not-asshole.  Good to see you again."
msgstr "Эй, привет, не-мудила.  Рада снова тебя видеть."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
