"Hmm, let me think.  There might be a few things I could scrounge up to help,"
" but it's going to take some time to sort through the scrap to find exactly "
"what you need.  How about this… some of my tools are getting a bit worn and "
"are in need of replacement.  If you could bring me a new angle grinder and a"
" hacksaw, I should be able to find all the parts you need by the time you "
"get back."
msgstr ""
"Хм, дай подумать.  Есть несколько деталей, которые могли бы помочь, но "
"потребуется время, чтобы разобраться во всём этом хламе и найти именно то, "
