#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "faction_base_bare_bones_basecamp_0"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/recipe_bare_bones_basecamp/recipe_bare_bones_basecamp.json
msgid ""
"We should survey the base site.  Note that we'll later have to manually "
"construct a bulletin board anywhere within the camp to actually be able to "
"use the camp."
