#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid ""
"We can use a smithy.  Let's start by building a spot to protect the workers "
"from the rain."
msgstr ""
"Нам пригодится кузница.  Давайте начнем с постройки места, чтобы защитить "
"рабочих от дождя."

