"Male, White, 8 y/o.\n"
"Height 50 inches ; Weight: 56 lbs.\n"
"Light Brown Hair, Brown Eyes\n"
"Wearing Red & Blue Striped Puffercoat, Red Knit Beanie, Brown Insulated Pants, Blue Schoolbag\n"
"Carrying: Paper Lunchbag\n"
"\n"
"ANYONE HAVING INFORMATION SHOULD CONTACT:\n"
"Boston Police Department Special Victims Unit - 508-555-4200"
