"\n"
"***PUBLIC INFORMATION***\n"
"\n"
"MISSING PERSON\n"
"***JUVENILE***\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a teenage girl wearing glasses and a silver necklace holding a plastic red cup.]\n"
"\n"
"ANNA LEE\n"
"Asian, Female\n"
"DOB: July 28, 2005 (16 years old)\n"
"5'4\" 107 lbs\n"
