#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream about the rain.  At first it's normal water, but soon changes into"
" a rain of spiders.  They cover you completely, crawling all over you, until"
" you wake up with a start."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится дождь.  Сначала это обычная вода, но вскоре она превращается в "
"дождь из пауков.  Они покрывают вас полностью, ползая по вам, пока вы не "
"проснулись, вздрогнув."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"It's your first day at school!  Unfortunately, the bus had to take a three-"
"hour detour, so you show up extremely late.  As you walk into the class, you"
" suddenly realize you forgot to put your pants on.  Even worse, your mother "
"walks in behind you and starts berating you in front of all your classmates."
msgstr ""
"Это ваш первый день в школе!  К сожалению, автобусу пришлось сделать "
"трёхчасовой объезд, поэтому вы опоздали.  Заходя в класс, вы внезапно "
"понимаете, что забыли надеть штаны.  Хуже того, ваша мама подходит к вам "
"сзади и начинает ругать вас на глазах у одноклассников."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream of running in an endless hallway.  You hear something gargantuan "
"chasing you with heavy breaths and wet squelching sounds.  You run until you"
" are out of breath and wake up feeling exhausted."
msgstr ""
"Вы бежите по бесконечному коридору.  Вы слышите, как что-то гигантское "
"преследует вас с тяжёлым дыханием и влажными хлюпающими звуками.  Вы бежали,"
" пока не запыхались и не проснулись, чувствуя себя измотанным."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You have a nightmare about drowning in a pit of biting, gnawing maggots.  "
"You wake up as they begin to choke you."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится кошмар о том, что вы тонете в яме с кусающимися и грызущими "
"личинками.  Вы просыпаетесь, когда вы начали задыхаться от них."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"In your dream, you are tied to a chair, slowly being lowered into a dark "
"pit.  A large metal hatch closes you into the darkness, and you awake, as it"
" clangs shut with an air of finality."
msgstr ""
"Во сне вас привязывают к стулу и медленно опускают в тёмную яму.  Большой "
"металлический люк закрывает вас во тьме, и вы просыпаетесь, когда он "
"захлопывается с ощущением что это конец."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream of flying.  You fly higher and higher until you are in outer "
"space.  You look back at Earth and see that it's cracked - something "
"slithering and vast is hatching from it."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится как вы летите.  Вы летите всё выше и выше, пока не оказались в "
"открытом космосе.  Вы оглядываетесь на Землю и видите, что она треснула — из"
" неё вылупляется что-то скользкое и огромное."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream that you're leaning over a bathroom sink, trying to winnow out "
"something that's hurting your gums.  You yank and wiggle until a six-inch-"
"long serrated tooth comes free."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится, что вы наклоняетесь над раковиной в ванной, и пытаетесь вытащить"
" что-то, что режет ваши дёсны.  Вы дёргаете и расшатываете, пока не "
"вырываете заострённый зуб длиной шесть дюймов."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You have a long and vivid nightmare about living in an old, stuffy building "
"with countless other people.  You try to get some rest but you can't.  You "
"try using the restroom but it's too cramped.  It gets so unbearable that you"
" feel sick, and you find that you've gagged yourself awake."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится долгий и яркий кошмар о том, как вы живете в старом, душном "
"здании с бесчисленным количеством других людей.  Вы пытаетесь немного "
"отдохнуть, но не можете.  Вы пытаетесь сходить в туалет, но там слишком "
"тесно.  Это становится настолько невыносимо, что вас тошнит, и вы понимаете,"
" что захлёбываетесь."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You have a strange dream about walking through a street from your childhood,"
" where every surface is the same shade of solid red.  You wake up startled "
"after noticing an equally red man down the street, moving quickly in your "
"direction."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится странный сон о том, как вы идете по улице из своего детства, где "
"каждая поверхность имеет один и тот же оттенок сплошного красного цвета.  Вы"
" вздрагиваете, заметив на улице такого же красного мужчину, быстро "
"движущегося в вашем направлении."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"In your dreams you feel as though you've learned something really, really "
"important.  You wake up in quiet distress, as you've already forgotten what "
"that something was."
msgstr ""
"Во сне вам кажется, что вы узнали что-то очень, очень важное.  Вы "
"просыпаетесь в тихом отчаянии, так как уже забыли, что это было."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream you're walking down the hallways of your high school, listening to"
" a baby cry, trying to find it.  A sense of inexplicable dread follows you "
"as you start to run through endless rooms and halls, unable to track it "
"down.  As you open your eyes in a groggy, still half-dreaming state, you "
"feel like you've failed at something important."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится, что вы идете по коридорам средней школы, слышите детский плач и "
"пытаетесь его найти.  Чувство необъяснимого страха преследует вас, когда вы "
"начинаете бегать по бесконечным комнатам и коридорам, не в силах его "
"выследить.  Когда вы открываете глаза в полусонном состоянии, вы чувствуете,"
" что потерпели неудачу в чём-то важном."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream about a shadowy figure, following you as you wander through the "
"apocalypse.  It seems to be ever closer whenever you check back.  You wake "
"with the disturbing feeling that you've had this dream before, but before "
"long you can't remember what it even was."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится призрачная фигура, которая следует за вами, пока вы блуждаете по "
"апокалипсису.  Кажется, что оно всё ближе, когда вы оборачиваетесь.  Вы "
"просыпаетесь с тревожным ощущением, что этот сон уже снился вам раньше, но "
"вскоре вы даже не можете вспомнить, о чём он был."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid "You wake up feeling that you lost something important."
msgstr "Вы просыпаетесь с ощущением, что потеряли что-то важное."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream about locking yourself in a school bathroom to avoid a bully.  You"
" hear sounds of the bully approaching in the hall, then hammering at the "
"door to the stall.  As the door gives way, the undead face of your bully "
"lunges towards you, teeth bared, before you wake up with a start."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится, что вы запираетесь в школьном туалете, чтобы спрятаться от "
"хулигана.  Вы слышите приближающиеся звуки в коридоре, а затем стук в дверь."
"  Когда дверь поддаётся, неживое лицо хулигана бросается к вам с обнажёнными"
" зубами, прежде чем вы вздрагиваете и просыпаетесь."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream a friend has dragged you to their weird church.  You find yourself"
" unable to follow anything the preacher says, until abruptly he points to "
"you and accuses you of causing the end of the world.  You try to argue, but "
"as they turn to you, you see the congregation are all zombies.  They stumble"
" your way, hands grasping, moaning that it's all your fault."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится, что друг затащил вас в свою странную церковь.  Вы не можете "
"понять ничего, что говорит проповедник, пока он внезапно не показывает на "
"вас и не обвиняет в том, что вы вызвали конец света.  Вы пытаетесь спорить, "
"но когда они поворачиваются к вам, вы видите, что всё собрание — зомби.  Они"
" спотыкаются на вашем пути, хватаются за руки и стонут, что это всё ваша "
"вина."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream about having a drink with an old friend.  In the dream you can't "
"remember why you haven't talked to them in a while.  As you finish up, they "
"look at you with empty, blackened eyes and ask why you didn't do anything to"
" help them.  The dream fades to another, but leaves you cold in the morning."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится как вы выпиваете со старыми друзьями.  Во сне вы не можете "
"вспомнить, почему давно с ними не разговаривали.  Когда вы заканчиваете, они"
" смотрят на вас пустыми, почерневшими глазами и спрашивают, почему вы ничего"
" не сделали, чтобы им помочь.  Сон сменяется другим, но проснувшись вы всё "
"ещё чувствуете холод."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"Your dream starts out pleasant, a happy memory of a vaguely-real family that"
" almost, but not quite, resembles your actual one.  Your pleasant thoughts "
"are broken by flames as the picture-perfect house you live in catches fire, "
"and your picture-perfect family just laughs and tells you not to bother as "
"you try to extinguish the flames."
msgstr ""
"Ваш сон начинается с приятного счастливого воспоминания о смутно-реальной "
"семье, которая почти, но не совсем, похожа на вашу настоящую.  Ваши приятные"
" мысли разрушаются пламенем, когда идеальный дом, в котором вы живёте, "
"загорается, а ваша идеальная семья просто смеется и советует вам не "
"беспокоиться, пока вы пытаетесь потушить пламя."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You have a nightmare that you're slowly turning into a zombie, starting with"
" the tips of your fingers.  At first you're going about your business in a "
"more mundane dream, but soon the spreading rot can't be ignored.  Nothing "
"slows the inevitable progression."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится кошмар, что вы медленно превращаетесь в зомби, начиная с кончиков"
" пальцев.  Поначалу вы занимаетесь своими делами, но вскоре "
"распространяющуюся гниль уже невозможно игнорировать.  Ничто не может "
"замедлить неизбежное гниение."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You have a dream where you're searching for food in the ruins of a city, but"
" everything you find turns out to be rotting zombie flesh when you get ready"
" to eat it.  You wake up feeling sick to your stomach."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится сон, в котором вы ищете еду в руинах города, но всё, что вы "
"находите, оказывается гниющей плотью зомби, когда вы вот-вот собираетесь её "
"съесть.  Вы просыпаетесь с ощущением тошноты."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream that the shadows are following you, coiling and writhing ever "
"closer when you aren't looking."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится, что тени следуют за вами, извиваясь все ближе, пока вы не "
"смотрите."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream that you've lost your house keys.  You bang on the door, but no "
"one answers.  Peering through the window, you see an elderly zombie knitting"
" in an armchair."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится, что вы потеряли ключи от дома.  Вы стучите в дверь, но никто не "
"отвечает.  Заглянув в окно, вы видите пожилого зомби, который вяжет в "
"кресле."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare where you are a zombie, but each time you "
"attempt to feed, your teeth fall out."
msgstr ""
"Вы просыпаетесь от кошмара, в котором вы зомби, но каждый раз, когда вы "
"пытаетесь поесть, у вас выпадают зубы."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream you are walking in a mall, but the corridors and stores are empty "
"and shuttered.  Something is watching you."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится, что вы идёте по торговому центру, но коридоры и магазины пусты и"
" закрыты ставнями.  Что-то наблюдает за вами."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare where the sirens and screams never stop, growing"
" louder every second."
msgstr ""
"Вы просыпаетесь от кошмара, где сирены и крики никогда не прекращаются, "
"становясь громче с каждой секундой."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream that you are alone, a toddler again, the radio chattering to "
"shelter in place, to stay inside and lock the doors."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится, что вы ещё ребёнок и вы одни, а радио говорит, чтобы вы укрылись"
" на месте, остались внутри и заперли двери."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
