msgid ""
"You dream of a menacing figure, shrouded in shadows as it directs undead "
"hordes, a puppet master pulling strings."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится грозная фигура, окутанная тенями, руководящая ордами нежити, "
"кукловод, дёргающий за ниточки."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream of someone you knew long ago.  You can't remember their name, but "
"you're sure they're dead by now."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится человек, которого вы знали давно.  Вы не можете вспомнить имя, но"
" вы уверены, что этот человек уже мёртв."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about being stoned to death, the crowd full of "
"wide-eyed maniacs, some holding pipes and crowbars."
msgstr ""
"Вы просыпаетесь от кошмара о том, что вас забили камнями до смерти, в толпе "
"маньяков с широко раскрытыми глазами, некоторые держат в руках трубы и ломы."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream of losing your mind, forgetting all that you know, and becoming "
"one of the many."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится, что вы сошли с ума, забыли всё, что знали и стали одним из "
"многих."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You have a nightmare about being in a car crash.  As you crawl free of the "
"wreckage, broken and bleeding, the horde descends upon you."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится кошмар о том, что вы попали в автокатастрофу.  Когда вы, истекая "
"кровью, выползаете из-под обломков, на вас обрушивается орда."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream of a small child tearing out your throat with their blackened "
"teeth."
msgstr "Вам снится, как маленький ребёнок рвёт вам горло почерневшими зубами."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You have a nightmare in which you walk through a river of blood, followed by"
" the dead you tried to leave behind."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится кошмар, в котором вы идёте по реке крови, а за вами следуют "
"мертвецы, которых вы пытались оставить позади."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream of slime, jiggling, wobbling, and oozing over your entire body.  "
"As you wipe at it, the flesh of your hand smears away."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится слизь, покачивающаяся и сочащаяся по всему вашему телу.  Когда вы"
" вытираете её, плоть вашей руки размазывается."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream of standing on the Eiffel Tower, watching Paris burn.  You're too "
"far above to make out who is still alive and who isn't, though you hear the "
"screams."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится, что вы стоите на Эйфелевой башне и смотрите как горит Париж.  Вы"
" слишком высоко, чтобы разобрать, кто ещё жив, а кто нет, хотя и слышите "
"крики."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream of a beautiful garden full of strange plants that defend you "
"against the undead.  When they've finished, their barbed tendrils turn on "
"you, paralyzing and restraining you until you wake screaming."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится прекрасный сад, полный странных растений, которые защищают вас от"
" нежити.  Когда они заканчивают с ними, их колючие усики набрасываются на "
"вас, парализуя и удерживая вас, пока вы не просыпаетесь с криком."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream that you're a time traveler.  You go back to tell your past self "
"about the horrors to come, but after hours of pleading, you just won't "
"listen."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится, что вы путешественник во времени.  Вы возвращаетесь, чтобы "
"рассказать себе из прошлого о грядущих ужасах, но после нескольких часов "
"мольб вы просто не слушаете."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You have a nightmare about fighting for days against a warrior clad in bone "
"armor.  Teeth clatter gently, woven into their hair.  When finally you are "
"defeated, the warrior removes their mask, but you wake before seeing their "
"face."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится кошмар о том, как вы несколько дней сражаетесь с воином, одетым в"
" костяные доспехи.  Вплетенные в его волосы зубы мягко стучат.  Когда он, "
"наконец, побеждает вас, воин снимает маску, но вы просыпаетесь, не успев "
"увидеть его лицо."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream you are a slug, and all is well until a child stands over you with"
" a salt shaker."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится, что вы слизняк, и всё хорошо, пока над вами не появляется "
"ребёнок с солонкой."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream you're walking in the woods.  There's no one around and your phone"
" is dead.  That's when you spot him."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится, что вы гуляете по лесу.  Вокруг никого, а ваш телефон разряжен."
"  Именно тогда вы и замечаете его."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You wake from a nightmare of being slowly devoured, starting with your toes."
msgstr ""
"Вы просыпаетесь от кошмара, когда вас медленно пожирают, начиная с пальцев "
"ног."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You wake from a nightmare of being torn to pieces, lying in the filth of the"
" road and waiting for the end."
msgstr ""
"Вы просыпаетесь от кошмара, когда вас разрывают на куски, вы лежите в "
"дорожной грязи и ждёте конца."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"A seemingly endless nightmare plagues you.  Years pass, and you are always "
"struggling alone in an unforgiving world, dying in solitude of old age."
msgstr ""
"Вас преследует, казалось бы, бесконечный кошмар.  Проходят годы, а вы всегда"
" боретесь в одиночестве в неумолимом мире, умирая в одиночестве от старости."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream that you are the last person on Earth.  You're surrounded by "
"\"people\" but you know they aren't human anymore."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится, что вы последний человек на Земле.  Вас окружают «люди», но вы "
"знаете, что они больше не люди."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You wake from a nightmare in which you endlessly stacked boxes in a factory,"
" overseen by an inhuman figure clothed in shadow."
msgstr ""
"Вы просыпаетесь от кошмара, в котором вы бесконечно складывали коробки на "
"фабрике под присмотром нечеловеческой фигуры, окутанной тенью."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream of a behemoth, towering over you and covered in bony tissue, its "
"face twisted with rage.  You run for as long as you can, but when its "
"massive fist comes down, you wake."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится чудовище, возвышающееся над вами и покрытое костной тканью, с "
"искаженным от ярости лицом.  Вы бежите столько, сколько можете, но когда его"
" массивный кулак опускается, вы просыпаетесь."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream of a beautiful and regal unicorn.  You feed it gems as it nuzzles "
"your hand.  When you run out of stones, it kicks you to death."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится красивый и царственный единорог.  Вы кормите его драгоценными "
"камнями, пока он нюхает вашу руку.  Когда у вас заканчиваются драгоценности,"
" он лягает вас насмерть."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You wake from a nightmare in which it had all started over again, 911 "
"ringing busy, the fires, and death in every street."
msgstr ""
"Вы просыпаетесь от кошмара, в котором всё началось сначала, номер 911 занят,"
" пожары и смерть на каждой улице."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream your boss is scolding you for allowing a zombie through security."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится, что ваш начальник ругает вас за то, что вы пропустили зомби "
"через охрану."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream that you're a meal delivery worker, delivering a slab of flesh and"
" some sodas to a zombie house party."
msgstr ""
"Вам снится, что вы разносчик еды, доставляющий кусок мяса и газировку на "
"вечеринку зомби."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You wake from a nightmare just as your plane crashes.  You remember screams,"
" the lifeless eyes of a zombie child, and her unmoving mother."
msgstr ""
"Вы просыпаетесь от кошмара в тот момент, когда ваш самолет терпит крушение."
"  Вы помните крики, безжизненные глаза ребёнка-зомби и её неподвижную мать."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#. ~ When writing nightmares, take care to (1) ensure they are generic enough
#. that getting the same nightmare twice in a row isn't too weird, and (2)
#. that they don't assume anything about the person having them.  If your
#. nightmare reads like a horror story or creepypasta, it is probably going
#. too far. In general, avoid too much description.
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You wake from a dream.  You were on your knees, lapping blood from the "
"floor."
msgstr ""
"Вы просыпаетесь ото сна.  Вы стояли на коленях и слизывали кровь с пола."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<weird_sky_thing>"
#. ~ Used within npc_socialize
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "purple meteor"
msgstr "фиолетовый метеор"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<weird_sky_thing>"
#. ~ Used within npc_socialize
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "broken line"
msgstr "ломаная линия"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<weird_sky_thing>"
#. ~ Used within npc_socialize
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "falling star"
msgstr "падающая звезда"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<weird_sky_thing>"
#. ~ Used within npc_socialize
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "moving stars"
msgstr "двигающиеся звезды"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<weird_sky_thing>"
#. ~ Used within npc_socialize
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "unusual darkness"
msgstr "необычная темнота"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<weird_sky_thing>"
#. ~ Used within npc_socialize
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "vanishing stars"
msgstr "исчезающие звезды"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<weird_sky_thing>"
#. ~ Used within npc_socialize
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "shuffled stars"
msgstr "перетасованные звезды"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<weird_sky_thing>"
#. ~ Used within npc_socialize
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "new constellation of stars"
msgstr "новое созвездие"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<weird_sky_thing>"
#. ~ Used within npc_socialize
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "green moon"
msgstr "зелёная луна"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "So do you like cats or dogs?"
msgstr "Ты любишь кошек или собак?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "It's nice to know that the <zombies> don't feel pain."
msgstr "Приятно знать, <zombies> не чувствуют боли."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "Wherever we end up, at least we're still alive, right?"
msgstr "Куда бы мы ни попали, по крайней мере, мы всё ещё живы, верно?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "Somehow, I don't think I'll be going back to my old job anytime soon…"
msgstr ""
"Почему-то мне кажется, что я вряд ли вернусь к своей старой работе в "
"ближайшее время…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "I am SO glad I don't need to deal with taxes or debt anymore."
msgstr "Я безумно рад, что мне больше не нужно оплачивать счета и кредиты."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "Geez, this is nothing like those Hollywood zombie films!"
msgstr "Твою ж, это совсем не как в тех голливудских фильмах про зомби!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "Do you ever think about the ethics of killing <zombies>?"
msgstr "Ты когда-нибудь думал, насколько этично убивать <zombies>?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"Do you think living on a farm is dangerous because the roosters might "
"attract <zombies>?"
msgstr ""
"Думаешь, что жить на ферме опасно, потому что петухи могут привлечь "
"<zombies>?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"I have dreamt of owning a house by the sea, but now I have nightmares of "
"what lurks beneath the waves."
msgstr ""
"У меня была мечта о доме у моря, но теперь мне снятся кошмары о том, что "
"скрывается под волнами."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"I liked walking through the forest, listening to the chirping of the birds "
"but now I am afraid that the birds might devour me."
msgstr ""
"Я любил гулять по лесу, слушать чириканье птиц, но сейчас я боюсь, что эти "
"птицы могут меня сожрать."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"So you wet your toothbrush AFTER you apply toothpaste?  That's so weird."
msgstr "Так ты мочишь зубную щетку ПОСЛЕ того как намазал пасту?  Это странно"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "So is it pronounced gif or gif?"
msgstr "Так это произносится как «гиф» или «джиф»?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "What do you think the president is doing right now?"
msgstr "Как думаешь чем сейчас занят президент?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"What do you like to listen to?  Personally I'm into bass-heavy post-glam "
"speed polka."
