#. ~ Description of UI widget "zenfs_environment_safe"
#. ~ Description of UI widget "zenfs_environment_safe_alt"
#: data/json/ui/zenfs/sidebar-thick.json
msgid ""
"Shows all <color_yellow>weather</color> & <color_yellow>location</color> "
"information. Includes a <color_yellow>safe mode</color> indicator and an "
"<color_yellow>expedition timer</color>."
msgstr ""
"Показывает информацию о <color_yellow>погоде</color>, "
"<color_yellow>локации</color>, индикатор <color_yellow>безопасного "
"режима</color> и <color_yellow>таймер экспедиций</color>."

#. ~ Description of UI widget "zenfs_vehicle_readout"
#: data/json/ui/zenfs/sidebar-thick.json
msgid ""
"While the active character is inside a vehicle, it's <color_yellow>facing "
"direction</color>, <color_yellow>current</color> & <color_yellow>target "
"speeds</color>, and <color_yellow>fuel</color> will be shown."
msgstr ""
"Пока персонаж находится внутри транспорта, показывает его "
"<color_yellow>направление движения</color>, <color_yellow>текущую</color> и "
"<color_yellow>целевую скорость</color> и <color_yellow>топливо</color>."

#. ~ Label of UI widget "zenfs_thick_sidebar"
