#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/vehicleparts/boards.json
msgid "board"
msgstr "кузов"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "board"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/boards.json
msgid ""
"A metal wall.  Keeps zombies outside the vehicle and prevents people from "
"seeing through it."
msgstr ""
"Металлическая стена.  Удерживает зомби снаружи транспорта и не позволяет "
"смотреть сквозь неё."

