msgstr "внешняя магазинная корзина"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "external shopping cart basket"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "external wire bike basket"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "external cargo rack"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/cargo.json
msgid ""
"Storage space, mounted outside your vehicle's armor and vulnerable to "
