#. ~ Skill name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/skills.json
msgid "smart guns"
msgstr "умное оружие"

#. ~ Description of skill "smart guns"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/skills.json
msgid ""
"Back in the 21st century marksmanship was an art whose mastery meant arduous"
" years of constant training and preparation.  There are computers for that "
"now."
msgstr ""
"До XXI века меткая стрельба была искусством, овладение которым требовало "
"долгих лет постоянных тренировок и подготовки.  Сейчас для этого есть "
"компьютеры."

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/skills.json data/mods/MindOverMatter/skills.json
msgid "metaphysics"
msgstr "метафизика"

#. ~ Description of skill "metaphysics"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/skills.json
msgid "Your ability to manipulate psionic energy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker afs_mon_migoturret
#: data/mods/Aftershock/speech.json
msgid "\"I have no mouth and yet I scream!\""
msgstr "«Я кричу, но у меня же нет рта!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker afs_mon_migoturret
#: data/mods/Aftershock/speech.json
msgid "\"¿Por qué?\""
msgstr "\"¿Por qué?\""

#. ~ Speech from speaker afs_mon_migoturret
#: data/mods/Aftershock/speech.json
msgid "\"Come closer little one.\""
msgstr "«Подойди поближе, кроха.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker afs_mon_migoturret
#: data/mods/Aftershock/speech.json
msgid "\"The better to eat you!  I don't actually think I eat anymore.\""
msgstr "«Я тебя съем!  Хотя я всё равно уже не ем.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker afs_mon_migoturret
#: data/mods/Aftershock/speech.json
msgid "\"Cyrus said if I was patient, he could get me a new body.\""
msgstr "«Кир сказал, если я потерплю, он достанет мне новое тело."

#. ~ Speech from speaker afs_mon_migoturret
#: data/mods/Aftershock/speech.json
msgid "\"Quem é Você?\""
msgstr "«Quem é Você?"

#. ~ Speech from speaker afs_mon_migoturret
#: data/mods/Aftershock/speech.json
msgid "\"Eu vou te matar!\""
msgstr "«Eu vou te matar!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker afs_mon_migoturret
#: data/mods/Aftershock/speech.json
msgid "\"I can't keep myself from killing you, please run!\""
msgstr "«Я едва сдерживаюсь от убийства, пожалуйста беги!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_utilibot_beehive
#: data/mods/Aftershock/speech.json
msgid "\"bzzzzzz.\""
msgstr "«бзззззз.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_human_biomachine
#: data/mods/Aftershock/speech.json
msgid "\"west, west, west, west, west\""
msgstr "«запад, запад, запад, запад, запад»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_human_biomachine
#: data/mods/Aftershock/speech.json
msgid "\"east, east, east, east, east\""
msgstr "«восток, восток, восток, восток, восток»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_human_biomachine
#: data/mods/Aftershock/speech.json
msgid "\"south, south, south, south, south\""
msgstr "«юг, юг, юг, юг, юг»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_human_biomachine
#: data/mods/Aftershock/speech.json
msgid "\"north, north, north, north, north\""
msgstr "«север, север, север, север, север»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_human_biomachine
#: data/mods/Aftershock/speech.json
msgid "\"Where am I?  Where am I?  Where am I?\""
msgstr "«Где я?  Где я?  Где я?»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_human_biomachine
#: data/mods/Aftershock/speech.json
msgid "\"It's very cold, It's very cold, It's very cold\""
msgstr "«Очень холодно, Очень холодно, Очень холодно»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_human_biomachine
#: data/mods/Aftershock/speech.json
msgid "\"dark, dark, where is everything\""
msgstr "«темно, темно, где всё»"

