#. ~ Description of "soft hazard suit"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/civilian_blue_collar.json
msgid ""
"A brightly colored, standard-fab pattern environmental suit for use in "
"industrial and medical settings.  Offers good protection from chemical and "
"radioactive hazards, but is not insulated against heat or cold.  Requires a "
"gasmask or sealed helmet for full protection."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
