msgid "Academy Technologist"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Academy Technologist" for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A senior technologist from the Planetary Academy of Khorat, sent to Salus IV"
" to oversee the procurement of valuable technological artifacts.  Although "
"generously equipped, you are neither a fighter nor a good fit for life in "
"the frontier.  You'd feel far more comfortable and capable commanding this "
"salvage operation from the faraway safety of your office."
msgstr ""

