msgstr "Текущие настройки"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_XE_RIDDLE_20"
#. ~ Key binding name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/config_menu.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/eoc_riddles.json data/raw/keybindings.json
