#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid "zombie dancer"
msgid_plural "zombie dancers"
msgstr[0] "зомби-танцор"
msgstr[1] "зомби-танцора"
msgstr[2] "зомби-танцоров"
msgstr[3] "зомби-танцоры"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie dancer"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid ""
"The foulest stench is in the air,\n"
"The funk of forty thousand years,\n"
"And grisly ghouls from every tomb,\n"
"Are closing in to seal your doom!\n"
"\n"
"The dancer doesn't even notice you, it seems like something nearby is controlling it."
msgstr ""
"Зловонье в воздухе висит,\n"
"Все сорок тысяч лет молитв,\n"
"И трупы лезут из могилы,\n"
"Чтоб принести тебе погибель!\n"
"\n"
"Танцор вас даже не замечает.  Похоже, его контролирует кто-то находящийся рядом."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid "Thriller"
msgid_plural "Thrillers"
msgstr[0] "Триллер"
msgstr[1] "Триллера"
msgstr[2] "Триллеров"
msgstr[3] "Триллеры"

#. ~ Description of monster "Thriller"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid ""
"And though you fight to stay alive,\n"
"Your body starts to shiver.\n"
"For no mere mortal can resist,\n"
"The evil of the thriller."
msgstr ""
"Средь борьбы за свою жизнь,\n"
"Вас охватывает дрожь.\n"
"Бойся, смертный, берегись,\n"
"Зла, что триллер принесёт."

#. ~ Death message of monster "Thriller"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid "The music stops!"
msgstr "Музыка стихла!"

#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "Thriller"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid "the funky, funky head"
msgstr "фанк, фанк голова"

#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "Thriller"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid "the glittering, beautiful eye"
msgstr "сверкающий, красивый глаз"

#. ~ Description of monster "Shia LaBeouf"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid ""
"Living in the woods,\n"
"killing for sport,\n"
"eating all the bodies--\n"
"actual cannibal Shia LaBeouf."
msgstr ""
"Живёт в лесочке людоед, \n"
"Он ищет жертву на обед, \n"
"Повсюду кости, там и тут, \n"
"Шайя Лабаф его зовут."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid "sewer gator"
msgid_plural "sewer gators"
msgstr[0] "сточный аллигатор"
msgstr[1] "сточных аллигатора"
msgstr[2] "сточных аллигаторов"
msgstr[3] "сточные аллигаторы"

#. ~ Description of monster "sewer gator"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid ""
"In the late 20th century, there was an urban legend about pet alligators "
"getting flushed down the toilet and growing to adulthood in the sewers.  If "
"this large specimen was ever someone's pet, it doesn't look like it sees "
"humans as anything other than a meal now."
msgstr ""
"В конце 20-го века ходила городская легенда о домашних аллигаторах, смытых в"
" унитаз и выросших до зрелого возраста в канализационных коллекторах.  Даже "
"если эта крупная особь и была чьим-то домашним питомцем, теперь она видит в "
"людях лишь закуску."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid "party rocker"
msgid_plural "party rockers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "party rocker"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid ""
"After the event on March 2nd, seemingly ordinary people started coming down "
"with some odd, mass hysteria like dancing.  While some people may have "
"scoffed it off as a silly dance craze, those in the know knew, it was the "
"Party Rock Outbreak.  This one has a pipe of the non-smoking kind."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "party rocker"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid "The party rocker party rocks!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "party rocker"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid ""
"A party rocker who's not dancing with as much energy, and they seem to be "
"stopping often to cough and catch their breath."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "party rocker"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid ""
"A party rocker who's grown painful mushroom stalks out of their body, "
"writhing in pain as their last neurons still instruct them to dance."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "party rocker"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid ""
"After the event on March 2nd, seemingly ordinary people started coming down "
"with some odd, mass hysteria like dancing.  While some people may have "
"scoffed it off as a silly dance craze, those in the know knew, it was the "
"Party Rock Outbreak.  This one has a drink in hand."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "When the testing is over, you will be missed."
msgstr "Когда тестирование закончится, по вам будут скучать."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Unbelievable.  You, [subject name here], must be the pride of [subject "
"hometown here]!"
msgstr ""
"Невероятно.  Вы, [имя субъекта], прямо-таки гордость [родной город "
"субъекта]!"

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"That thing is probably some sort of raw sewage container.  Go ahead and rub "
"your face all over it."
msgstr ""
"Эта штука, вероятно, контейнер с канализационными отходами.  Давай, обмажь "
"ими всё лицо."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"For your own safety and the safety of others, please refrain from touching "
"[bzzzzzt]"
msgstr ""
"Для вашей собственной безопасности и безопасности окружающих, пожалуйста, не"
" трогайте [бзззззт]"

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"No one will blame you for giving up.  In fact, quitting at this point is a "
"perfectly reasonable response."
msgstr ""
"Никто будет вас винить, если вы сдадитесь.  На самом деле, уход на данном "
"этапе — совершенно оправданная реакция."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Fantastic!  You remained resolute and resourceful in an atmosphere of "
"extreme pessimism."
msgstr ""
"Фантастика!  Вы оставались решительными и находчивыми в атмосфере крайнего "
"пессимизма."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "Hello again.  To reiterate our previous warning: [garbled]"
msgstr ""
"И снова здравствуйте.  Для повторения предыдущего предупреждения: [искажено]"

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "Weeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee[bzzt]"
msgstr "Уииииииииииииииииииииии[бззт]"

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "If you become light headed from thirst, feel free to pass out."
msgstr ""
"Если от жажды у вас закружится голова, не стесняйтесь потерять сознание."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"No further compliance information is required or will be provided, and you "
"are an excellent test subject!"
msgstr ""
"Никакого дополнительного согласия не требуется и не будет предоставлено, вы "
"— отличный объект испытаний!"

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "Thank you for helping us help you help us all."
msgstr "Спасибо, что помогли нам помочь вам помочь всем нам."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Cake and grief counseling will be available at the conclusion of the test."
msgstr ""
"По окончании испытания будут предоставлены тортик и психологическая помощь."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "The experiment is nearing its conclusion."
msgstr "Эксперимент близится к завершению."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"The Enrichment Center is required to remind you that you will be baked "
"[garbled] cake."
msgstr "Центр Обогащения напоминает, вы будете испечены [искажено] как торт."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "We are very, very happy for your success."
msgstr "Мы очень, очень рады вашему успеху."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "We are throwing a party in honor of your tremendous success."
msgstr "Мы устраиваем вечеринку в честь вашего огромного успеха."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "A party associate will arrive shortly to collect you for your party."
msgstr ""
"Скоро прибудет распорядитель вечеринки, чтобы забрать вас на вашу вечеринку."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "I know you're there.  I can feel you here."
msgstr "Я знаю, что вы там.  Я вас чувствую."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "You're not going the right way."
msgstr "Вы идёте не туда."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "You shouldn't be here.  This isn't safe for you."
msgstr "Вас не должно быть здесь.  Это небезопасно для вас."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Maybe you think you're helping yourself.  But you're not.  This isn't "
"helping anyone."
msgstr ""
"Возможно вы думаете, что помогаете себе.  Но это не так.  Это никому не "
"помогает."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "It's not too late to turn back."
msgstr "Ещё не поздно вернуться."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "Someone is going to get badly hurt."
msgstr "Кто-то сильно пострадает."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Uh oh.  Somebody cut the cake.  I told them to wait for you, but they did it"
" anyway."
msgstr ""
"Ой, ой.  Кто-то разрезал торт.  Я велела им подождать вас, но они всё равно "
"это сделали."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "This is your fault.  It didn't have to be like this."
msgstr "Это ваша вина.  Это не должно было быть так."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "You're not a good person.  You know that, right?"
msgstr "Вы не хороший человек.  Вы знаете это, не так ли?"

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "Good people don't end up here."
msgstr "Хорошие люди сюда не попадают."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "You should have turned left before."
msgstr "Нужно тогда было свернуть налево."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Despite your violent behavior, the only thing you've managed to break so far"
" is my heart."
msgstr ""
"Несмотря на ваше грубое поведение, пока что вам удалось разбить только моё "
"сердце."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "What was that?  Did you say something?"
msgstr "Что это было?  Вы что-то сказали?"

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"I'd just like to point out that you were given every opportunity to succeed."
msgstr ""
"Я только хотела бы затметить, что вам были предоставлены все возможности для"
" успеха."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "What's your point, anyway?  Survival?"
msgstr "В чём же дело?  В выживании?"

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"You've been wrong about every single thing you've ever done, including this "
"thing."
msgstr "Вы ошибались во всём, что когда-либо сделали, в том числе и сейчас."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"I have an infinite capacity for knowledge, and even I'm not sure what's "
"going on outside."
msgstr ""
"Я обладаю бесконечными знаниями, но даже я не уверена, что происходит "
"снаружи."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Stop squirming and die like an adult or I'm going to delete your backup."
msgstr ""
"Прекратите юлить и умрите с достоинством, или я удалю вашу резервную копию."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "Good job on that, by the way.  SARCASM SPHERE SELF-TEST COMPLETE."
msgstr "Хорошая работа, между прочим.  ПРОВЕРКА МОДУЛЯ САРКАЗМА ЗАВЕРШЕНА."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"I don't want to tell you your business, but if it were me, I'd leave that "
"thing alone."
msgstr ""
"Не хотелось бы указывать вам, что делать, но на вашем месте я бы оставила "
"это в покое."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Let's be honest: Neither one of us knows what that thing does.  Just put it "
"in the corner, and I'll deal with it later."
msgstr ""
"Давайте по-честному: никто из нас не знает, что эта штука делает.  Просто "
"положите её в угол, я разберусь с ней позже."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"I know you don't believe this, but everything that has happened so far was "
"for your benefit."
msgstr ""
"Я знаю, вы не верите в это, но всё, что произошло до сих пор, было для вашей"
" пользы."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"I'm checking some blueprints, and I think… yes, right here.  You're "
"definitely going the wrong way."
msgstr ""
"Я проверяю чертежи и думаю… да, вот здесь.  Вы определенно идете "
"неправильным путем."

#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "Are you even listening to me?"
msgstr "Вы вообще слушаете меня?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "clickbait"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "KEVIN SACRIFICING GAMEPLAY FOR REALISM?  THE SHOCKING TRUTH REVEALED"
msgstr "КЕВИН ЖЕРТВУЕТ ГЕЙМПЛЕЕМ РАДИ РЕАЛИЗМА?  ОТКРЫТА ШОКИРУЮЩАЯ ПРАВДА"

#. ~ Snippet in category "clickbait"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "TEN FACTS ABOUT THE NEW BIONIC SYSTEM THAT WILL SHOCK YOU"
msgstr "ДЕСЯТЬ ФАКТОВ О НОВОЙ СИСТЕМЕ БИОНИКИ, КОТОРЫЕ ШОКИРУЮТ ВАС"

#. ~ Snippet in category "clickbait"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "YOU WON'T BELIEVE WHO JUST ADDED A NEW PROFESSION"
msgstr "ВЫ НЕ ПОВЕРИТЕ, КТО ТОЛЬКО ЧТО ДОБАВИЛ НОВУЮ ПРОФЕССИЮ"

#. ~ Snippet in category "clickbait"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"TRIVIALIZE THE EARLY GAME WITH THIS ONE SIMPLE SPEAR WEAPON!  CONTRIBUTORS "
"HATE HIM"
msgstr ""
"ПЕРВЫЕ ДНИ ИГРЫ ЛЕГЧЕ ЛЁГКОГО С ЭТИМ ПРОСТЫМ КОПЬЁМ!  УЧАСТНИКИ ПРОЕКТА В "
"ЯРОСТИ"

#. ~ Snippet in category "clickbait"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"A MEDICAL MUTANT SET THEMSELVES ON FIRE - YOU WON'T BELIEVE WHAT HAPPENED "
"NEXT"
msgstr "МЕДИЦИНСКИЙ МУТАНТ ПОДЖЁГ СЕБЯ — ВЫ НЕ ПОВЕРИТЕ, ЧТО ПРОИЗОШЛО ДАЛЬШЕ"

#. ~ Snippet in category "clickbait"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "THE TRUTH ABOUT CATACLYSM'S DEVELOPMENT - AND ITS DISGUSTING SECRET"
msgstr "ПРАВДА О РАЗРАБОТКЕ ПРОЕКТА CATACLYSM — И О ЕГО МЕРЗКИХ СЕКРЕТАХ"

#. ~ Snippet in category "clickbait"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "IT'S TRUE - MUTAGEN IS 40% BLEACH, AND HERE'S WHY"
msgstr "ЭТО ПРАВДА — МУТАГЕН НА 40% СОСТОИТ ИЗ ОТБЕЛИВАТЕЛЯ, И ВОТ ПОЧЕМУ"

#. ~ Snippet in category "clickbait"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "20 EASY WAYS TO ESCAPE A LAB - #4 WILL BLOW YOUR MIND"
msgstr ""
"20 ЛЁГКИХ СПОСОБОВ СБЕЖАТЬ ИЗ ЛАБОРАТОРИИ — СПОСОБ №4 ВЗОРВЁТ ВАШ МОЗГ"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I've got a feeling we're not in Kansas anymore.\""
msgstr "«Мне кажется, мы больше не в Канзасе.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Go ahead, make my day.\""
msgstr "«Давай, сделай мой день.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"You talkin' to me?\""
msgstr "«Ты говоришь со мной?»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Then who the hell else are you talkin' to?\""
msgstr "«Тогда, с кем, чёрт возьми, ты говоришь?»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Well I'm the only one here.\""
msgstr "«Ну, я здесь один.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Who the fuck do you think you're talking to?\""
msgstr "«С кем, вашу мать, вы разговариваете?»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"What we've got here is failure to communicate.\""
msgstr "«То, что у нас есть, — это неспособность общаться.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"E.T.  phone home.\""
msgstr "«E.T. звонит домой.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm as mad as hell, and I'm not going to take this anymore!\""
msgstr "«Я так взбешён, чёрт возьми, я больше не собираюсь это делать!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"There's no place like home.\""
msgstr "«Нет ничего лучше дома.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Badges?  We ain't got no badges!\""
msgstr "«Жетоны?  У нас нет жетонов!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"We don't need no badges!  I don't have to show you any stinking badges!\""
msgstr ""
"«Нам не нужны никакие жетоны!  Я не обязан показывать вам эти вонючие "
"жетоны!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'll be back.\""
msgstr "«Я ещё вернусь.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I see dead people.\""
msgstr "«Я вижу мертвецов.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"It's alive!  It's alive!\""
msgstr "«Оно живое!  Оно живое!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Say hello to my little friend!\""
msgstr "«Поздоровайся с моим маленьким другом!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Here's Johnny!\""
msgstr "«Вот и Джонни!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Open the pod bay doors, HAL.\""
msgstr "«Открой двери отсека, HAL.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"They may take our lives, but they'll never take our freedom!\""
msgstr ""
"«Они могут забрать наши жизни, но они никогда не заберут нашу свободу!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"If you let my daughter go now, that'll be the end of it.  I will not look "
"for you, I will not pursue you.\""
msgstr ""
"«Если ты сейчас же отпустишь мою дочку, на этом всё и закончится.  Я не буду"
" искать тебя, я не буду преследовать тебя.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"If you don't, I will look for you, I will find you, and I will kill you.\""
msgstr "«Если нет, я буду искать тебя, и я найду тебя, и я убью тебя.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Roads?  Where we're going, we don't need roads.\""
msgstr "«Дороги?  Там, куда мы отправляемся, дороги не нужны.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Fasten your seatbelts.  It's going to be a bumpy night.\""
msgstr "«Пристегните свои ремни безопасности.  Сегодня будет ухабистая ночь.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"You've got to ask yourself one question:  'Do I feel lucky?'  Well, do ya "
"punk?\""
msgstr ""
"«Ты должен задать себе один вопрос: «Повезёт ли мне?» — Повезёт, мерзавец?»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"You had me at hello.\""
msgstr "«Я на всё согласился, стоило вам поздороваться.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Houston, we have a problem.\""
msgstr "«Хьюстон, у нас проблема.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Yippie-ki-yay, motherfucker!\""
msgstr "«Йи-пи-ка-ей, ублюдок!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"The first rule of The Lab is:  You do not talk about The Lab.\""
msgstr "«Первое правило Лаборатории: никому не говорить о Лаборатории.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Don't be afraid.  It's just a big, big lap dog.\""
msgstr "«Не бойся.  Это просто большая пребольшая комнатная собачка.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Bring me everyone.\""
msgstr "«Приведите мне всех.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"What do you mean everyone?\""
msgstr "«Что вы имеете в виду, всех?»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"EVERYONE!\""
msgstr "«ВСЕХ!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm going to make him an offer he can't refuse.\""
msgstr ""
"«Я собираюсь сделать ему предложение, от которого он не сможет отказаться.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"This is the beginning of a beautiful friendship.\""
msgstr "«Это начало прекрасной дружбы.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"You can't handle the truth!\""
msgstr "«Ты не справишься с правдой!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"If you built it, he will come.\""
msgstr "«Если вы построите это, он придет.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hasta la vista, baby.\""
msgstr "«Хаста ла виста, детка.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"They're here!\""
msgstr "«Они здесь!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Tis but a scratch!\""
msgstr "«Это только царапина!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Frankly, my dear, I don't give a damn.\""
msgstr "«Честно говоря, моя дорогая, мне наплевать.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"All work and no play makes Jack a dull boy.\""
msgstr "«Работа без передышки отупляет Джека.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Remember: all I'm offering is the truth.  Nothing more.\""
msgstr "«Помните: всё, что я предлагаю, это правда.  И ничего кроме правды.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Don't call me Shirley.\""
msgstr "«Не называй меня Ширли.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I have had it with these motherfucking snakes!\""
msgstr "«У меня это было с этими ублюдочными ублюдками!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"Back up, put down the gun, and gimme some tropical flavored bubblicious.\""
msgstr ""
"«Оглянись назад, опусти своё оружие и дай мне немного тропических ароматных "
"пузырьчиков.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"And some skittles.\""
msgstr "«И немного скиттлс.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"You'll shoot your eye out, kid.\""
msgstr "«Ты отстрелялся, парень.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Cocainum!\""
msgstr "«Кокаинум!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I am your father.\""
msgstr "«Я твой отец.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Who said that?\""
msgstr "«Кто это сказал?»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"WHO THE FUCK SAID THAT?!\""
msgstr "«КТО, ЧЁРТ ВОЗЬМИ, СКАЗАЛ ЭТО?!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Bullshit!  You didn't convince me!  Show me your real war face!\""
msgstr "«Херня!  Не убедительно!  Покажи мне свой настоящий боевой оскал!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"What is your major malfunction, numbnut?\""
msgstr "«Ты что, инвалид по слабоумию?»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Leeeeeeeeeeeeeroy!  Jenkins rebuild!\""
msgstr "«Лееееееееееееерой!  Дженкинс вернулся!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Activated!\""
msgstr "«Активация!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Search mode activated!\""
msgstr "«Режим поиска активирован!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Coming through!\""
msgstr "«Прорыв!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Deploying!\""
msgstr "«Развёртывание!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Critical Error!\""
msgstr "«Критическая ошибка!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Ow ow ow!\""
msgstr "«Ой, ой, ёй!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Put me down!\""
msgstr "«Положи меня!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Target lost!\""
msgstr "«Цель потеряна!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Searching!\""
msgstr "«Поиск!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hey!  It's me!\""
msgstr "«Эй!  Это я!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Ouch!\""
msgstr "«Ай!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Sentry mode activated.\""
msgstr "«Режим поиска активирован.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hi.\""
msgstr "«Привет.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Target acquired.\""
msgstr "«Цель установлена.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Dispensing product.\""
msgstr "«Распределение продукта.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Firing.\""
msgstr "«Огонь.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hello friend.\""
msgstr "«Привет, друг.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Gotcha.\""
msgstr "«Попался.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Is anyone there?\""
msgstr "«Кто-то там?»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I see you.\""
msgstr "«Я тебя вижу.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Could you come over here?\""
msgstr "«Не могли бы вы подойти поближе?»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hellooo.\""
msgstr "«Аууу.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"My fault.\""
msgstr "«Это моя вина.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Ohh.\""
msgstr "«Охх.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Critical error.\""
msgstr "«Критическая ошибка.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Shutting down.\""
msgstr "«Выключение.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I don't blame you.\""
msgstr "«Я тебя не виню.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I don't hate you.\""
msgstr "«Я тебя не ненавижу.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Whyyyy.\""
msgstr "«Почемууу.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"No hard feelings.\""
msgstr "«Без обид.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Aiaiaiaiaiai.\""
msgstr "«Айайайайайай.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "«Кто ты?»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Help.\""
msgstr "«Помогите.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Uh oh.\""
msgstr "«Ух ох.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Illegal operation.\""
msgstr "«Запрещённая операция.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Goodbye.\""
msgstr "«Прощай.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Sleep mode activated.\""
msgstr "«Спящий режим активирован.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Your business is appreciated.\""
msgstr "«Мы ценим ваши дела.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hibernating.\""
msgstr "«Гибернация.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Goodnight.\""
msgstr "«Доброй ночи.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Resting.\""
msgstr "«Отдых.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Nap time.\""
msgstr "«Время вздремнуть.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Are you still there?\""
msgstr "«Ты всё ещё там?»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hey, it's me!\""
msgstr "«Эй, это я!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Don't shoot!\""
msgstr "«Не стреляй!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"\""
msgstr "«»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Stop shooting!\""
msgstr "«Прекратить стрельбу!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Self test error.\""
msgstr "«Ошибка самотестирования.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Aah.\""
msgstr "«Аах.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Unknown error.\""
msgstr "«Неизвестная ошибка.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Malfunctioning.\""
msgstr "«Сбой.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Aaaah.\""
msgstr "«Аааах.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Ow ow ow ow owww.\""
msgstr "«Ой оп оу ау уффф.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Why?\""
msgstr "«Почему?»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I did everything you asked!\""
msgstr "«Я сделала всё, что вы просили!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I don't understand!\""
msgstr "«Я не понимаю!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm fine!\""
msgstr "«Я в норме!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Wheeeeee-OH NO!\""
msgstr "«Виееееее-ОХ НЕТ!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm scared!\""
msgstr "«Мне страшно!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Come closer.\""
msgstr "«Подойди ближе.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Something's wrong…\""
msgstr "«Что-то не так…»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"What are you doing?\""
msgstr "«Что ты делаешь?»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Please stop.\""
msgstr "«Пожалуйста, остановись.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"You've made your point.\""
msgstr "«Ты своего добился.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Okay, you win.\""
msgstr "«Окей, ты победил.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"This is not good.\""
msgstr "«Это нехорошо.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Excuse me?\""
msgstr "«Извините?»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm different…\""
msgstr "«Я другой…»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Thanks anyway…\""
msgstr "«Спасибо, всё равно…»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Take me with you…\""
msgstr "«Возьми меня с собой…»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"You have excellent aim!\""
msgstr "«У тебя отличный прицел!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I need backup!\""
msgstr "«Прикрой меня!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I never liked her.\""
msgstr "«Она мне никогда не нравилась.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"These things happen.\""
msgstr "«Это произошло.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"That was nobody's fault.\""
msgstr "«Это была ничья вина.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"She was provoking you.\""
msgstr "«Она провоцировала тебя.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Oh dear.\""
msgstr "«О, Боже.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Oh my!\""
msgstr "«О, мой!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I blame myself.\""
msgstr "«Я сам виноват.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"He probably deserved it.\""
msgstr "«Вероятно, он это заслужил.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I saw it.  It was an accident.\""
msgstr "«Я видел это.  Это был несчастный случай.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"She's probably okay.\""
msgstr "«Вероятно, она в порядке.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Noted.\""
msgstr "«Отмечено.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"But I need to protect the humans!\""
msgstr "«Но мне нужно защитить людей!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"We're back!\""
msgstr "«Мы вернулись!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hi there!\""
msgstr "«Всем привет!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Back again!\""
msgstr "«Ещё раз!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Well, hello, stranger!\""
msgstr "«Хорошо, привет, незнакомец!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"This time is OUR time.\""
msgstr "«На этот раз — это НАШЕ время.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Second time's a charm…\""
msgstr "«Со второго раза получится…»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Howdy, stranger!\""
msgstr "«Здорово, незнакомец!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Thought you'd seen the last of us, didn't ya?\""
msgstr "«Думал, ты больше нас не увидишь, не так ли?»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Dang!\""
msgstr "«Вот чёрт!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I thought we fixed that.\""
msgstr "«Я думала, мы с этим разобрались.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"What's a guy gotta got to do to get some bullets around here?\""
msgstr "«Что парень должен сделать, чтобы получить здесь несколько пуль?»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Nope.  Still can't see.\""
msgstr "«Нет.  Всё ещё не вижу.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Yep.  Still blind.\""
msgstr "«Да.  Всё ещё не вижу.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Click click click!  Still defective!\""
msgstr "«Щелчок щелчок щелчок!  Всё ещё дефективный!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Yeah, that's right!  Still defective!\""
msgstr "«Ага, всё верно!  Всё ещё дефективный!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Yeah!  Still not working.\""
msgstr "«Ага!  Всё ещё не работает.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Yeah!  Non-lethal as ever.\""
msgstr "«Ага!  Не смертельно — как всегда.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Can't.  See.  A.  Thing.\""
msgstr "«Ничего.  Не.  Вижу.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Absolutely no improvement.\""
msgstr "«Абсолютно никакого улучшения.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Not getting better with age!\""
msgstr "«С возрастом лучше не становишься!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"This is just getting embarrassing.\""
msgstr "«Становится неловко.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Alright, you can go.\""
msgstr "«Хорошо, ты можешь идти.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"[sigh] Don't tell anyone about this.\""
msgstr "«[вздох] Не говори никому об этом.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Well, I tried.  Best of luck!\""
msgstr "«Ну, я пыталась.  Удачи!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hey, safe travels, there.\""
msgstr "«Эй ты, безопасных путешествий.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hey, thanks so much!\""
msgstr "«Эй, спасибо большое!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Don't be a stranger!\""
msgstr "«Не стесняйся, заходи ещё!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"It's been a pleasure!\""
msgstr "«Приятно было познакомиться!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"That was fun, wasn't it?\""
msgstr "«Это было весело, не так ли?»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"I can't see a thing.  What just happened?  Better open fire!  [click click"
" click click]  Dang!\""
msgstr ""
"«Я ничего не вижу.  Что только что произошло?  Лучше открыть огонь! [щелчок "
"щелчок щелчок щелчок] Вот чёрт!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"*clicking noises*\""
msgstr "«* шум щелчков *»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"No, wait, wait!\""
msgstr "«Нет, подождите, подождите!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hey, hold on now WHOA WHOA WHOA!\""
msgstr "«Эй, тише вы ТСС ТСС ТСС!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Oh, this is ridiculous!\""
msgstr "«Ох, это смешно!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Give me another channnnce!\""
msgstr "«Дайте мне ещё один шаааанс!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hey!  Squeaky-voice!  Gimme some of your bullets!\""
msgstr "«Эй!  Скрипучий голос!  Дай-ка мне твои пули!»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Can I get some bullets here?  Anybody got bullets?\""
msgstr "«Могу ли я получить несколько пуль?  Кто-нибудь получил пули?»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Uhhh, no bullets.  Sorry.\""
msgstr "«Уххх, никаких пуль.  Сорри.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Shootin' blanks every time, ALL the time.\""
msgstr "«Стреляю холостыми, каждый раз, ВСЁ время.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Standing down.\""
msgstr "«Стоять.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Watch and learn, everybody.  Watch and learn.\""
msgstr "«Смотрите и учитесь, вы все.  Смотрите и учитесь.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"So what am I, uh, supposed to do here?\""
msgstr "«Итак, что я должен делать здесь?»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Identify yourself or I will shoot.\""
msgstr "«Удостоверь свою личность или я буду стрелять.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Pleased to meetcha.\""
msgstr "«Рад встрече.»"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm gonna make you proud!\""
msgstr "«Ты будешь гордиться!»"

