msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Dabbler (Peaceful Rest)"
msgstr "Дилетант (Мирный отдых)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Peaceful Rest)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#, c-format
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell."
"  In your case, Peaceful Rest.  Ever since you were a child, you dreaded "
"bedtime.  Falling asleep was an ordeal, a battle between you and the bed, "
"and it seemed like no matter how many sheep you counted, sleep hygiene "
"habits you practiced, or exhausted you felt, it was an hour or more until "
"you finally fell into sleep.  You became a mage because you were tired of "
"having 5% of your life stuck staring at the ceiling while waiting for sleep "
"to come, and ever since the world ended, you're even more grateful you can "
"fall asleep whenever you need to."
msgstr ""

