#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Electrical Engineer"
msgstr "Инженер-электрик"

#. ~ Description of profession "Electrical Engineer" for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You followed your parents' wishes and became an engineer, and to your "
"surprise you were extremely good at it.  It was like the electronics you "
"built just spoke to you, like you could see inside the wires and circuits, "
"and then when the sky broke that literally came true."
msgstr ""
"Ты последовал желаниям своих родителей и стал инженером, и, к твоему "
"удивлению, у тебя это очень хорошо получалось.  Казалось, что созданная "
"тобой электроника просто разговаривала с тобой, как будто ты мог видеть "
"внутри проводов и схем, а затем, когда небо разверзлось, это буквально "
"сбылось."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Electrical Engineer"
msgstr "Инженер-электрик"

#. ~ Description of profession "Electrical Engineer" for female
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
