msgid "As you unleash your powers, you feel a strange tingling sensation."
msgstr "При освобождении своих сил вы ощущаете странное покалывание."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_RAISE_ATTUNEMENT_BELOW_THRESHOLD_MAINTENANCE"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_RAISE_ATTUNEMENT_BELOW_THRESHOLD_MAINTENANCE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
