#. ~ Description of monster "feral regenerator"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This feral human doesn't even have bloodshot eyes.  Their skin positively "
"glows, and as you watch them brush past a jagged chunk of wood to get to "
"you, the wound they receive immediately stops bleeding and rapidly begins to"
" close."
