"%1$s waves its fronds and your %2$s is engulfed in flames, but they do not "
"burn you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster attack "mon_fountain_of_flames" message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/triffids.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s waves its fronds and <npcname>'s %2$s is engulfed in flames, but it "
"does not burn them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "triffid flamebreaker"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/triffids.json
