#. start of mission "Kill the warp-draining elite zombies!"
#. ~ Name of the monster group "GROUP_SI_ZOMELITE" placed on map update on
#. start of mission "Kill the warp-draining elite zombies!"
#. ~ Name of the monster group "GROUP_SI_ZOMBOSS" placed on map update on
#. start of mission "Kill the warp-draining zombie lord!"
#. ~ Name of the monster group "GROUP_SI_ZOMBOSS" placed on map update on
#. start of mission "Kill the warp-draining zombie superteam!"
