#. start of mission "Kill the warp-draining zombie leader!"
#. ~ Name of the monster group "GROUP_SI_ZOMBOSS" placed on map update on
#. start of mission "Kill the warp-draining zombie horde lord!"
#. ~ Name of the monster group "GROUP_SI_ZOMEASY" placed on map update on
#. start of mission "Kill the warp-draining zombie horde lord!"
#. ~ Name of the monster group "GROUP_SI_MIGO" placed on map update on start
#. of mission "Kill the warp-draining mi-go threat!"
#. ~ Name of the monster group "GROUP_SI_MIGO" placed on map update on start
