#. ~ Description of mission "Upgrade: Scouting 1"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"Completing this mission will unlock a permanent upgrade for all future expeditions.\n"
"\n"
"Craft a Scouting Lens from high quality lenses and miscellaneous parts.  The Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe inside your mind.\n"
"\n"
