#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid ""
"Some sort of fruit sealed in a thick shell.  The shell is rigid but seems "
"surprisingly brittle; you could easily peel it open to see what's inside "
"with your bare hands."
msgstr ""

#. ~ "description" action message of item "mysterious fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
