#. ~ Description of "inventor's noise EMP grenade"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid ""
"A small energy grenade with an additional timer and a whistle slapped onto "
"it.   When triggered, the timer will start to count to 70 seconds.  As it "
"ends a huge EMP explosion will cover the zone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "inventor's noise fire grenade"
msgid_plural "inventor's noise fire grenades"
msgstr[0] ""
